    {
      "id": "s05",
      "type": "SEARCH_NARROW",
      "transition": "zoom",
      "background": "zoneA",
      "narration": "Here's how I'd tell a colleague to find it. In the sidebar. Inside that, the Notifications block. Inside that, the Email alerts switch. Notice what happened — each step didn't add to a selector, it shrank the room. By the time we get to that switch there's exactly one place it could be, and nothing else on the page can be confused for it.",
      "data": {
