    {
      "id": "s15",
      "type": "SEALED_BOX",
      "transition": "zoom",
      "background": "zoneA",
      "narration": "In Playwright, though? Get by label just walks in. So does get by role. Plain CSS, same story. Every locator you already know pierces an open shadow root, for free, without anybody asking it to. One exception, mind. XPath genuinely cannot see inside — it's the only tool in the box that can't.",
      "data": {
        "sealedBox": {
